55709093827_7234041850784137373_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mdj-wISYiGQQ7kNvwEQB6b9&_nc_oc=AdrZUwLffD_ENoyOVHUTrrrfPVCdkUNdb5aqw8xXQTnlEXNSwKWAE_-4TGHsfg9DifI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTRxUJy5ApvyA_YzoMVMVvAhWljB1hi6UAONC-ntBTTjA&oe=6B006F92"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "JAS_PV_cover1.png", "id": "649181138258808", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618432_649181141592141_4738211282412047997_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KFpeLXJICVYQ7kNvwEEUrNV&_nc_oc=AdoTZTBABJ3XQHGi1VYC6JKHKTWJmNfehV0W516kDruc2i5VPBTIZH9R1BTg75WoDm8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT_CkdGDg7SJB6fk5cCgOQBcvyZgsgLQhWhvuHAXL7WSQ&oe=6B005CBA"}, "display_name": "JAPAN ACTIVITY SIMULATOR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "There are over 28 different experiences based on the four paths of Bushido, Tea Ceremony, Flower Arrangement, and Calligraphy!\nAll activities are certified with ranks and titles!\n We have a wide variety of activities, from mindfulness activities like Samurai, Ninja, Tea Ceremony, Flower Arrangement, Kanji, Zazen, Hot Springs, and Sushi!\n We also have a wide variety of games and activities, from creative activities that express the soul to traditional Japanese games!\n{1119488606821638}\nRemove the tarnish from the sword and polish and align your mind as well\n{1184257777030409}\nEveryone is equal inside the tea room Regardless of rank, everyone should enter with their heads bowed\n{2944312539085173}\nArrange flowers of each season freely, and create whatever your heart desires, \nsuch as Chinese characters in ink paintings\n{1262677395914942}\nBeyond the 28+ activities, finding all the hidden \u201ckokeshi\u201ddolls will unlock a door to a new world", "short_description": "Experience the thrill of Japan\nUnder the moonlight, there is said to be a J